          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಇಬ್ಬನಿ — ibbani — \"dew\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬೆಳಗ್ಗೆ ಹುಲ್ಲಿನ ಮೇಲೆ ಇಬ್ಬನಿ ಇತ್ತು. beḷagge hullina mēle ibbani ittu. In the morning there was dew on the grass."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Drops on leaves at dawn after a cold night."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
